// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : scripts/SpawnDefs/War_05_01/_src/War_05_01_Atmospheric.xls 	Sheet : Info_Faultline 
//
// Script      : Xlstospawndef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Script Variable Greeting :
"P2771452164" "So I said, 'Ninjas and lawyers? Then it's a Tsoo Sue Studio!' <em=laugh> Get it?  Sue like litigation versus Tsoo the gang?  No?  Oh nevermind, no one appreciates an artiste.<em=hi f=a>Hey, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P1647089241" "<em=hi f=a>Hi, {HeroName}, some important conference huh?<em=none>"
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P3751307507" "<em=lecture f=a>Oh, hey, {HeroName}.  Fancy shindig, huh?"
// Script Variable RestrictedText :
// Script Variable InfoText :
"P3001494538" "So you may be wondering why I'm all dressed up in this fancy suit.  Oh, Serpent Drummer already told you?   Okay.  So you call that dressing up?  Anyway, 'nette and I are on security for this conference.  Only the best for world peace, right?<br><br>So far so good.  It's been pretty quiet, actually.  Everyone is surprisingly civil.  It kind of makes me nervous, if you want the truth.  Anyway, Serpent Drummer slipped in the back door a few minutes ago, so maybe you should go talk to him.  He's got that purposeful stare about him and it's directed at you."
// Script Variable Leave :
"P719622616" "Take his advice and find the others"
// DisplayName for N_Faultline :
"P3230763425" "Faultline"

// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Generated by transModule
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : scripts/SpawnDefs/War_05_01/_src/War_05_01_Atmospheric.xls 	Sheet : Info_Fusionette 
//
// Script      : Xlstospawndef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Script Variable Greeting :
"P4002432891" "<em=bigwave f=a> {HeroName}!  'scuse me, guys.<em=none>"
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P1735457061" "<em=bigwave f=a>It's my strong and capable yet highly twitchy relative {HeroName}!  Sorry, guys, family beckons!<em=none>"
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P3511760367" "<em=point f=a>Oh look!  It's {HeroName}!  And over there is my BOYFRIEND, the one who controls EARTHQUAKES.<em=none>"
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P3912352227" "<em=smack>No, I will NOT.  Didn't your mama teach you any manners?  Honestly.  HEY!  EYES UP HERE.<em=none><em=hi f=a> {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P642605220" "<em=no>Really, guys, I'm flattered, but I'm just here for security, and NOTHING ELSE.<em=none><em=talk f=a>Hey, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable RestrictedText :
// Script Variable InfoText :
"P1138548214" "No no no!  Don't hurt them!  They're just making conversation!  They were completely and totally respectful of me and my person at all times!  Please, do not instigate an argument on my account! <br><br> <color pink>What pigs.  Seriously.  I'm not kidding.  I was this close to blasting them into next week.  Good thing you got here.  What's with the get-up?  This is supposed to be formal.  Oh.  Whoops.</color>  <br><br>What?  Oh, no, that's not at all necessary!  I'm sure Faultline understands they were just inquiring about heightened security measures for the peace conference!  You don't have to tell him at ALL!<br><br>  <color pink>That'll fix their little red wagons.  Even those Rikti Traditionalists had better manners.  Well, except that one.  He kept saying, ''nette:  Sup?'   Someone needs to take away his Mark 1 decoder.</color><br><br>Like my attire?  I picked it up from Icon.  I practically had to beat Serge senseless before he'd give me a decent deal.<br><br>So, hey, did you talk to Faultline and Serpent Drummer yet?"
// Script Variable Leave :
"P3597407200" "Compliment her outfit then find Serpent Drummer"
// DisplayName for N_Fusionette :
"P3277183394" "Fusionette"

