// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : scripts/SpawnDefs/War_05_01/_src/War_05_01_Atmospheric.xls 	Sheet : Info_Gaussian 
//
// Script      : Xlstospawndef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Script Variable RestrictedText :
// Script Variable InfoText :
"P3828606046" "<color deepskyblue>Dreams of Peace and Acts of War<br>Part: One<br><br></color>I'm here for security, not idle chit chat.  If Serpent Drummer requested you oversee this conference, you'll want to check in with him.  He's right over there."
// Script Variable Leave :
// DisplayName for N_Gaussian :
"P2720100831" "Gaussian"

// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Generated by transModule
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : scripts/SpawnDefs/War_05_01/_src/War_05_01_Atmospheric.xls 	Sheet : Info_General_Aarons 
//
// Script      : Xlstospawndef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Script Variable RestrictedText :
// Script Variable InfoText :
"P2363696608" "<color deepskyblue>Dreams of Peace and Acts of War<br>Part: One<br><br></color>I am General Aarons, government liaison to these peace negotiations. Every time I think I've seen it all, something unbelievable happens.<br><br>Not too long ago we were invaded by these Rikti aliens. Worst day in history, worse than Brass Monday or even D-Day when the 5th Column blew the heck out of Independence Port. Sad... sad day.<br><br>But now, here I am standing across a table from a Rikti Traditionalist trying to sign a peace treaty. They seem like they mean it, like they want to stop the bloodshed, but if I've learned one thing in all my years, it's that you have to learn to expect the unexpected.<br><br>Good day, {HeroName}."
// Script Variable Leave :
// DisplayName for N_General_Aarons :
"P3904283191" "General Aarons"

// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Generated by transModule
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : scripts/SpawnDefs/War_05_01/_src/War_05_01_Atmospheric.xls 	Sheet : Info_Levantera 
//
// Script      : Xlstospawndef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Script Variable RestrictedText :
// Script Variable InfoText :
"P2295107719" "<color deepskyblue>Dreams of Peace and Acts of War<br>Part: One<br><br></color>Vanguard Security has been heightened throughout the rest of the base so that we can observe the conference proceedings.  If Serpent Drummer has requested your assistance, you must have great potential."
// Script Variable Leave :
// DisplayName for N_Levantera :
"P2891772753" "Levantera"

// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Generated by transModule
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : scripts/SpawnDefs/War_05_01/_src/War_05_01_Atmospheric.xls 	Sheet : Info_Rikti_Regal 
//
// Script      : Xlstospawndef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Script Variable RestrictedText :
// Script Variable InfoText :
"P150545446" "<color deepskyblue>Dreams of Peace and Acts of War<br>Part: One<br><br></color>Before the coming of Heroes: My people peaceful. Our creators taught: War an excess: Producing only death: Despair.<br><br>Among us: Some Rikti maintain: Counter belief system. Preference: Continue warfare.<br><br> I: We: Not among those. We: Traditionalist. Belief: ways of peace: Ways of Knowledge. This legacy: We desire to foster."
// Script Variable Leave :
// DisplayName for N_Rikti_Regal :
"P2932495559" "Traditionalist Ambassador: Il'los"

// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Generated by transModule
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : scripts/SpawnDefs/War_05_01/_src/War_05_01_Atmospheric.xls 	Sheet : Info_SerpentDrummer 
//
// Script      : Xlstospawndef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Script Variable Greeting :
"P3546693498" "{HeroName}, good to see you.  Let's talk a moment."
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P50310699" "Greetings, {HeroName}."
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P2303857416" "{HeroName}.  Greetings.  Come over here for a moment."
// Script Variable RestrictedText :
// Script Variable InfoText :
"P614803997" "<color deepskyblue>Dreams of Peace and Acts of War<br>Part: One<br><br></color> I've been watching the conference for a little while and, so far, everything is progressing according to plan.  We have diplomats and Rikti Traditionalists in the same room and there is no bloodshed.<br><br>I should be glad about this, but I'm not.  <br><br>Nothing ever runs this smoothly during a conference where peace between two worlds is on the line.  I need to stay here for a while longer so make sure you keep an eye on Lady Grey. If you haven't found her yet, <color orange>slip out the corridor behind me and look at the security computer.</color>  She hasn't reported in for a while.  <br><br>Faultline, Fusionette, and I can keep an eye on things in here."
// Script Variable Leave :
// DisplayName for N_Serpent_Drummer :
"P2130280555" "Serpent Drummer"

